                            {
                                "example_id": "01972e00-ea2d-4e28-95b6-9ce250ff57fd",
                                "sense_id": "7094d1bb-7b72-303d-8306-e5af24be4d91",
                                "text": "Een TOKO van puike DRANKEN.\nEen TOKO om fraaie CADEAUTJES te koopen\nEen TOKO om sterke, mooie IJzeren LEDIKANTEN met toebehooren te koopen.\nEen TOKO van alle soorten BANKET en SUIKERWERK. […]",
                                "translation": "A shop for excellent DRINKS.\nA shop where you can buy beautiful GIFTS\nA shop where you can buy strong, beautiful IRON COTS with accessories.\nA shop for all types of BANQUET and SWEETS."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd3fd59a-cb2f-3a93-b58f-c33d25cd4681",
